                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino njiimbe makani aamuyandwi wangu. Njiimbe lwiimbo lwamuyandwi wangu lwakwaamba makani aamuunda wakwe wamasaansa. Muyandwi wangu kajisi muunda wamasaansa mukalundu ikali avu ibotu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dt 32:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakalima-lima, wagwisya mabwe, wazikila musaansa mubotu loko, alimwi wakayaka ingazi, akusya idindi lyakusinina masaansa. Lino wakali kulangila kuti uzyale micelo, pele wakazyala micelo yamusokwe buyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 3:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubantu bakede mu-Jerusalemu abantu boonse ba-Juda, amubeteke makani aangu amakani aamuunda wangu wamasaansa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa kwakasyaala cintu niciba cimwi ncindakabula kucitila muunda wangu? Ino nkaambonzi, ciindi eco nindakali kusyoma kuti ulazyala masaansa, wakazyala masaansa aamusokwe buyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuswiilile, nkamulwiide ncinti citile muunda wangu, Njoogwisya lubaya lwawo, elyo uyooligwa; njoomwaya bulambo bwawo, elyo uyoolyataulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoousaala. Taukooyoosonzolwa nikuba kusagwidwa. Kuyooboneka myuunga amitubetube buyo mulinguwo. Alimwi njoolailila mayoba kuti aleke kuwisya imvula alinguwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo muunda wamasaansa wa-Jehova wamakamu nduzubo lwa-Israyeli, abalo bantu ba-Juda musamu wakwe mubotu, Wakali kulangila lubeta, pele wakajana kupenzya buyo; wakali kulangila bululami, pele wakajana kulila buyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
