                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kagoma anyeele anamalwa akantimbwa awaini, zyoonse zilajanwa mumapobwe aabo, pele tababiki myoyo yabo kumilimo ya-Jehova, ancito zyamaanza aakwe tabaziboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.12",
