                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamba kuti, Abindane akufwambya milimo yakwe, kuti twiibone. Makanze aa-Musalazi wa-Israyeli aswene kufwaafwi, aze, kuti tuzibe mbwaabede!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.19",
